  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LSMS-ISA Burkina Faso Panel Surveys</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">It was decided to perform an overall large-scale experiment duplicating the survey that was done in 2014 to measure poverty. The 2014 survey uses a different methodology that the LSMS-ISA survey which will be used for the foreseeable future as decided by the WAEMU for the region. The scale of the experimentcomma collecting data from 1comma500 householdscomma required use of the funds for both experiments. Thuscomma the number of the experiments was cut from two to one.</narrative>
  </description>
